    "category": "Exceptions",
    "question_hi": "Agar exception handle nahi kiya jaaye toh kya hota hai?",
    "answer_hi": "**Interview Answer (Simple English):**\r\n\r\n> Agar ek exception handle nahi kiya jaata, toh program execute hona band kar deta hai aur Python ek error message display karta hai jise traceback kaha jaata hai. Traceback error ka type, error message, aur code mein error kahan hui, ye dikhata hai.\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n\r\n```python id=\"r6t8kp\"\r\nnumber = 10 / 0\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:**\r\n\r\n```text\r\nZeroDivisionError: division by zero\r\n```\r\n\r\nYahan, program isliye ruk jaata hai kyunki exception handle nahi kiya gaya tha.\r\n\r\n### **Short Version (20 seconds):**\r\n\r\n> Agar `try-except` use karke exception handle nahi kiya jaata, toh program terminate ho jaata hai aur Python error type, message, aur wo line jahan error hui, wo containing ek traceback dikhata hai.\r\n\r\n💡 **Easy way to remember:**\r\n\r\n* **Handled exception → Program continue hota hai** ✅\r\n* **Unhandled exception → Program crash + traceback dikhta hai** ❌",
    "question_en": "What happens if an exception is not handled?",
    "answer_en": "**Interview Answer (Simple English):**\r\n\r\n> If an exception is not handled, the program stops executing and Python displays an error message called a traceback. The traceback shows the type of error, the error message, and where the error occurred in the code.\r\n\r\n**Example:**\r\n\r\n```python id=\"r6t8kp\"\r\nnumber = 10 / 0\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Output:**\r\n\r\n```text\r\nZeroDivisionError: division by zero\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere, the program stops because the exception was not handled.\r\n\r\n### **Short Version (20 seconds):**\r\n\r\n> If an exception is not handled using `try-except`, the program terminates and Python shows a traceback containing the error type, message, and the line where the error occurred.\r\n\r\n💡 **Easy way to remember:**\r\n\r\n* **Handled exception → Program continues ✅**\r\n* **Unhandled exception → Program crashes + traceback shown ❌**",
